      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "敗還洛陽，皆斬於東市；蔡璜自陽翟降齊王冏，還洛自殺；王輿以功免誅，後與東萊王蕤謀殺冏，又伏法。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p016"
