    {
      "number": 59,
      "category": "",
      "title": "晉書卷五十九·司馬穎",
      "paragraph_id": "c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p010",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "數年，開封間有傳穎子年十餘歲，流離百姓家，東海王越遣人殺之。永嘉中，立東萊王蕤子遵為穎嗣，封華容縣王。後沒于賊，國除。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
